    "public_preview": null,
    "text": "Leave a 🧡 below to affirm! If no one has told you lately: I’m proud of you.\n\nNot just for the milestones you’ve reached, but for the battles you’ve fought in private, the boundaries you’ve learned to honor, and the moments you chose to keep going when giving up would’ve felt easier.\n\nHealing isn’t always about becoming someone new. Sometimes it’s about simply remembering that you deserve joy, love, peace, and a life that doesn’t require you to abandon yourself.\n\nMay these words find the part of you that needs them most today.\n\nWritten by: @wlliegreene_\n\nFor more daily healing, find our debut book, postcards, and 2026 calendar at wetheurban.com (in bio)",
